body:
An optimized modpack based on Create for those who want to build complex mechanisms without FPS drawdowns. The build contains only proven add—ons to Create, which expand automation, logistics and engineering, but do not overload the game.

What the modpack adds:

Advanced conveyors, pipes, and sorting to automate production at any scale.;

additional energy sources and storage facilities for stable operation of large factories;

tools for fine—tuning mechanisms and diagnostics to make it easier to find bottlenecks.;

optimize the rendering and loading of chunks so that the build remains smooth even with a lot of details.

Why download it: if you like to build large factories in Create and want everything to work quickly and predictably. The build has been tested for stability and does not contain conflicting mods.
